e":"3","role":0,"stats":[45,45,81,75,88,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014902","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10957","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[45,45,81,75,88,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014902","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1000808","name":{"zh":"曹节完婚","en":"Cao Jie's Wedding"},"year":"209","month":"4","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"曹操嫡女，卞夫人所生。建安十八年，与姐姐曹宪、妹妹曹华一同入宫，建安二十年，取代被废的伏皇后成为汉室正宫。曹丕篡汉时，当众将传国玉玺掷于阶下，怒斥使者“天不祚尔”。汉献帝被贬为山阳公后，她随其迁居山阳郡，以医术济世，临终前仍要求按汉家皇后礼制下葬，与刘协合葬于禅陵。","tc":"曹操嫡女，卞夫人所生。建安十八年，與姐姐曹憲、妹妹曹華一同入宮，建安二十年，取代被廢的伏皇后成為漢室正宮。曹丕篡漢時，當眾將傳國玉璽擲于階下，怒斥使者“天不祚爾”。漢獻帝被貶為山陽公后，她隨其遷居山陽郡，以醫術濟世，臨終前仍要求按漢家皇后禮制下葬，與劉協合葬于禪陵。","en":"Cao Cao's daughter, born to Lady Bian. In the eighteenth year of Jianan, she entered the palace alongside her elder sister Cao Xian and younger sister Cao Hua. In the twentieth year of Jianan, she replaced the deposed Empress Fu to become Empress of the Han. When Cao Pi usurped the Han throne, she threw the Imperial Seal onto the steps before the assembled court, sternly berating the envoy: ‘Heaven shall never bless you!’ After Emperor Xian was demoted to Duke of Shanyang, she followed him to Shanyang Commandery, practicing medicine to aid the people. On her deathbed, she requested to be buried according to the rites of a Han empress, and was laid to rest beside Liu Xie in the Chanling Mausoleum.","jp":"曹操の嫡女。母は卞夫人。建安十八年、姉の曹憲、妹の曹華と共に入宮し、建安二十年に廃位された伏皇后に代わって漢室の正后となった。曹丕が漢を簒奪した際、人々の前で伝国玉璽を階下に投げ捨て、使者を「天、汝を祚わいせじ」と叱責した。漢の献帝が山陽公に降封されると、夫に従って山陽郡へ移り住み、医術をもって世を救った。臨終に際しても漢の皇后の礼制に則って葬られることを求め、劉協と共に禅陵へ合葬された。","kr":"조조의 적녀이자 변부인의 소생이다. 건안 18년, 언니 조헌, 동생 조화와 함께 입궁하였으며, 건안 20년에는 폐위된 복황후의 뒤를 이어 한실의 정궁이 되었다. 조비가 한나라를 찬탈할 당시 많은 이들이 보는 앞에서 전국옥새를 섬돌 아래로 내던지며 사신을 향해 '하늘이 너희에게 복을 내리지 않을 것이다!'라고 꾸짖었다. 헌제가 산양공으로 강등되자 함께 산양군으로 이주하여 의술로 세상을 구제하였고, 임종 직전 한나라 황후의 예법에 따라 장사를 치를 것을 청하여 유협과 함께 선릉에 합장되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10199","remark":"","surname":"曹","surnameTc":"曹","surnameEn":"Cao","surnameJp":"曹","surnameKr":"조","surnameOther":"","name":"节","nameTc":"節","nameEn":"Jie","nameJp":"節","nameKr":"절","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"曹节","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"204","city":"CS1026","gender":"1","rule":"45","force":"45","wise":"81","politics":"75","charm":"88","will":"85","ruleTalent":"3","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"3/3/3/3/3/75/42/3","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"16;1003405","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1005705","warSoulPoint":"1600","battleSoulPoint":"2000","debateSoulPoint":"6000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1007401","professions":"1/0/0/0/0/0/0/2/2/1/0/1/0/1/0/4/0/1/4/1/1/0/2/1","attribute2":"65/65/85/79/88/85","morality":"4","compatible":"16","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"191","show":"204","death":"260","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014902","helmet":"WP1013102","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;11/1;20/1;21/1;29/1;31/1;41/1;42/1;58/1","father":"WJ10001/0","mother":"WJ10134/0","children":"","family":"WJ1029215/100;WJ10425/100;WJ10136/100;WJ10966/100;WJ10644/100;WJ10817/100;WJ10109/100;WJ1024815/100;WJ1015515/10